 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Torikago no Kaguyahime"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "鳥籠のかぐや姫"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kaguya, scorned as the \"Demon Princess,\" has spent her days enduring harsh treatment.\n\nSince childhood, she possessed a strange power—one that should have been capable of vanquishing the monstrous Youei that threaten the nation. Yet, no one understood her, forcing her to suppress her emotions and live in solitude.\n\nOne day, Takakatsu Gion, the leader of the Kurotobi, an elite group tasked with exterminating the Youei, appears before her with an unexpected proposal—he wishes to form a \"temporary marriage\" with her. But for what purpose...?",
   "ja": "\"妖の姫\"とさげすまれて折檻される日々を送っていたかぐや。\nかぐやは幼いころから奇妙な力を持っていた。それは国を揺らがす化け物・妖影を退治する力であるはずだったが、誰にも理解されず心を殺して生きていた。\nそんなかぐやの元を、妖影退治を行う\"黒鳶\"の大将祇王隆勝が訪ね、「仮初の結婚」をしたいと申し入れてきて――！？"
  },
